            mod.widgets.HagencyListNote{padding:Inset{left:2 right:7 top:2 bottom:6} text:A.t("A template sets the name and role of an Agent this pool may host later. Saving one doesn’t create or change a running Agent.","模板预先写好新 Agent 的名称和角色。保存模板不会创建或修改正在运行的 Agent。")}
